#4471 was merged as one known parser bug. The cause of a report is not the intake tag. It comes from the tenant: whether that locale writes the day first, and, on the form channel, whether the booking form tells people to type the month first.

`parser`: the shared parser reads the month first, and the tenant writes the day first.

`hint`: the booking-v3 form prints MM/DD/YYYY, the person types the month first, and the form reads the day first.

<Callout kind="warn">
This ticket was marked known as one bug. The table shows every cause in it. A cause that is not the ticket's own has no ticket yet.
</Callout>

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

Filed for each cause: [parser](https://github.com/bigboyTaysh/s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1), which this ticket already owns, and [hint](https://github.com/bigboyTaysh/s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2), which had no ticket of its own.

